Flags:
      --as as-value               HOW the gap ended. One vocabulary with the bench's dispositions since #342 — a reader no longer has to know which verb produced a closure before it can interpret the word
  -h, --help                      help for close
      --id gap-id                 REQUIRED — the gap id
